WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
If you take blood pressure or other heart medications, this one is important.

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.080
If you normally take your blood pressure medication in the morning, please take

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.000
it with a small sip of water.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.680
However, please confirm this with your doctor's office in advance, as

5
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.500
recommendations can vary depending on your specific medication.

6
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.490
Do not skip your blood pressure medication without checking with them first,

7
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:24.690
keeping your blood pressure stable during the procedure is important for your

8
00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.000
safety and your doctor wants to make sure you're set up well before you arrive.
